/**
 * Post-extract Investee Portal V8 runtime patches.
 *
 * Run after extract-investee-portal-v8.mjs (or alone on the current runtime):
 *   node scripts/patch-investee-portal-runtime.mjs
 *
 * Why this exists: scripts/extract-investee-portal-v8.mjs does an unconditional
 * full overwrite of matanho-investee-portal-runtime.js from the vendor source
 * tree. The committed runtime.js has substantial hand-built "live data" wiring
 * (session-user auth bridge, liveOnly/useMockData threading, live-aware nav
 * badge counts, live branches in every page renderer, the window.MatanhoInvesteeUI
 * global that lib/investee-portal-v8/actions.ts dispatches through) that does
 * NOT exist in the raw vendor source and would be silently discarded by a raw
 * re-extraction — this is the exact incident class that already happened once
 * on the sibling Portfolio module (commit ba32eef silently discarded 20
 * hand-patched live-data action wirings; see
 * design-refs/portfolio-investee-gap-analysis-and-plan.md and
 * scripts/patch-portfolio-runtime.mjs, which protects Portfolio the same way).
 *
 * Unlike Portfolio's bridge (one contiguous block reinjected via
 * scripts/portfolio-runtime-live-bridge.inc.js), the Investee Portal hand-patches
 * are ~33 separate hunks scattered across almost the entire file (every page
 * renderer gets its own live-data branch), derived from a line-level diff
 * between a fresh unpatched extract and the previously-committed, hand-patched
 * runtime.js. Each hunk below is either:
 *  - a "replace" (find = the raw/vendor line(s) this hunk supersedes, addBlock =
 *    the hand-patched replacement) or
 *  - an "insertion" (find = a stable, unique anchor line already present in a
 *    fresh extract; addBlock is inserted immediately before it).
 * Every find/addBlock pair below was verified (at generation time) to occur
 * exactly once in a fresh raw extract / the committed runtime respectively, so
 * a plain string search-and-replace is safe. Idempotent: each step first checks
 * whether addBlock is already present (skip) before checking for find (apply);
 * if neither is present, it warns MISS instead of guessing — matching the
 * lesson learned on patch-portfolio-runtime.mjs, where a plain
 * ".replace(anchor, newBlock + anchor)" with no addBlock guard silently
 * duplicated content on repeated runs.
 *
 * Hand-patch inventory (one line each):
 *  - 0-startInvesteePortalV8Runtime: session-user auth bridge import (applySessionUserToProfile/clientDesignSignOut/getClientDesignSessionUser/onClientDesignSessionUser) from client-design-mock/runtime-auth
 *  - 1-initialPage: liveOnly flag derived from options.liveOnly (defaults true)
 *  - 2-hunk: MATANHO_CONFIG.useMockData driven by !liveOnly instead of hardcoded true
 *  - 3-hunk: second useMockData:!liveOnly override in the config merge
 *  - 4-navGroups: nav badge seed counts on Reporting/Governance/Signatures/Requests/Messages nav items
 *  - 5-store: state gets liveOnly/liveData/liveLoading/livePayload/liveLoadError/navMounted fields
 *  - 6-barChart: cluster of live*() data accessors + computeNavCounts/navCountMarkup/renderNav (badge-aware)/syncNavActive/syncNavCounts + ip8Skel/pageSkeleton loading skeletons
 *  - 7-dashboardPage: dashboardPage live branch — renders real application/company/term-sheet/reporting data when state.liveData is true
 *  - 8-kpisPage: kpisPage live branch — renders live financial KPI values from the company record instead of mock kpis[]
 *  - 9-reportsPage: reportsPage live badge + tab wiring for live reporting/financial report counts
 *  - 10-reportTabBody: reportTabBody live schedule/history tables sourced from liveReportingRequests()/liveFinancialReports()
 *  - 11-focusForecastCell: forecastsPage live branch (empty-state pending backend, per design-refs/investee-portal-v8-backend-asks.md)
 *  - 12-termsPage: termsPage live branch — renders the real term sheet record, sign/download actions
 *  - 13-capTablePage: capTablePage live branch
 *  - 14-governancePage: governancePage live branch open
 *  - 15-requestsPage: requestsPage (Capital & Procurement) live branch
 *  - 16-dataRoomPage: dataRoomPage (Document Vault) live branch using liveApplicationDocuments()
 *  - 17-messagesPage: messagesPage live branch
 *  - 18-settingsPage: settingsPage live branch / render() wiring to call syncNavCounts + pageSkeleton while liveLoading
 *  - 19-appEl: render() dispatch updated for live skeleton + nav sync
 *  - 20-navigate: navigate() live-aware adjustments
 *  - 21-documentDrawer: documentDrawer/signature pad live wiring
 *  - 22-el: handleAction click dispatcher: live-aware branches begin
 *  - 23-action-navigate: handleAction: additional live action ids wired before falling through
 *  - 24-themeHost: handleAction: theme/command/notifications live wiring
 *  - 25-action-kpi-detail: handleAction: 'new-request' action wired
 *  - 26-u: handleAction: notifications/company-menu drawer copy live-aware
 *  - 27-action-complete-folder: event listener registration gets __ip8Sig abort-signal (folder completion handler)
 *  - 28-__ip8SessionOff: session-user subscription — onClientDesignSessionUser(() => applySessionUserToProfile(rootEl)) wired after first render
 *  - 29-hunk: setPage() re-render call passes { nav: 'active' } to keep nav badges in sync
 *  - 30-co: api object gains hydrate(payload) — feeds state.livePayload/liveData, refreshes company name in the DOM, re-renders nav counts
 *  - 31-hunk: destroy() unsubscribes the session-user listener (__ip8SessionOff)
 *  - 32-hunk: window.MatanhoInvesteeUI global (hydrate/getSnapshot/notify/closeOverlays) that lib/investee-portal-v8/actions.ts dispatches live API results through
 */
